{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\">Problem 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/6/1d613d74982ae51affe0dea99ff08bcc8c751b79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(a-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{a}}\\right)^7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"93\" height=\"46\" /> the coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/d/e8d3b6f26c0270245e351172862e616b359e0221.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{-\\dfrac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/a/4eac72a72d8f655352cc87f245d55c6acafad14b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -7 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ -21 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 21 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"420\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Binomial_Theorem\" title=\"Binomial Theorem\">Binomial Theorem</a>, each term of the expansion is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/0/fc096ef9b195d8d209d13d9baf8912ad21366043.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{7}{n}(a)^{7-n}(\\frac{-1}{\\sqrt{a}})^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"139\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p><p>We want the exponent of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/7/a7748d3d38355a68b51bddc29d7647230728287e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" />, so \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef069221780aa5c4c41d9b7a06915542b41f07d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(7-n)-\\frac{1}{2}n=-\\frac{1}{2}\\]\" width=\"151\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/d/54da3ef5038264b11bb5de1e87ce53c2c79361aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-\\frac{3}{2}n = -\\frac{15}{2}\\]\" width=\"95\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/8/9987073b195bd588fd170ce3c6bf4e8bae71a6a4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n = 5\\]\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84e75ddd39b9408f4d8e7fa62d2f6cdca00232de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, then the corresponding term is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cfe5f098da4387d48e266ee3b01945bc4480d8f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\binom{7}{5}(a)^{2}(\\frac{-1}{\\sqrt{a}})^5\\]\" width=\"113\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/104d031ce649dfbff71b8c298c0959e6f6976c0e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-21a^{-\\frac{1}{2}}\\]\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\